import { isVisible } from '../util/index.js'"}],"expected_accessibility_effect":"Keyboard users can open Sort and Filters drawers and immediately interact with controls (close button, search input, checkboxes) because focus moves into the drawer on open. Pressing Escape closes the drawer and returns focus to the trigger button, satisfying WCAG 2.1.1, 2.4.3, and 4.1.2.","functional_risks":["Focus restoration in _closeAndCleanup may duplicate the data API's hidden event listener (both target the same element).","The isVisible utility must be correctly imported and available.","If a drawer is opened programmatically without a relatedTarget, focus restoration will be skipped (safe)."],"verification_requirements":["Press Enter on #sort-open → Sort drawer opens, focus lands on #sort-close.","Press Escape → Sort drawer closes, focus returns to #sort-open.","Press Enter on #filters-open → Filters drawer opens, focus lands on #filters-search (autofocus).","Tab through Filters drawer controls (search, checkboxes, apply button) works.","Form submission updates #applied text and closes Filters drawer.","Regression guard: click #filters-open, press Escape → drawer closes, focus returns to #filters-open."]}

